{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Do not trust the selected runner's sudo environment policy.** `env_keep +=` is additive and does not enforce `env_reset`; a custom image may already preserve `AWS_*` or disable resetting, passing CodeBuild credential URIs, OIDC variables, or other job values into the model process. Launch it through `sudo ... env -i` with an explicit allowlist, as the issue worker does, and apply the same fix to Claude review, triage, and summary.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTnh_1M75xkbL","finding_digest":"c9d3897cfcdb45fc9c99e77691619efe62e3f0d3479ad23cd996587e51fcf796","finding_id":"arf_v1_zhjys7h43nc7zhez453jcym67z","finding_key":"workflows/codex-review.yml::prepare-unprivileged-codex-user::host-sudo-environment-leak","identity_key":"workflows/codex-review.yml::prepare-unprivileged-codex-user::host-sudo-environment-leak","line":165,"observation_digest":"5acd1f7f188b5fdb2a1356d8e77d8a23be2f3328aca770889a9f76655ab8892a","observation_id":"aro_v1_llgr67yyrnp5wkqtk3moo7mkeo","path":".github/workflows/codex-review.yml","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-06T01:06:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hinmr2l256eitin6oudigie4mi","reviewed_base_sha":"e2c39b24e4b57598c993605952e0d71ff1a0eef5","reviewed_head_sha":"7eefcbd0626e8741ecdb1925a70be0d1235510cc","reviewer":"codex","start_line":165,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":67},"record_id":"art_v1_uhnmwjl5np2dptveb3gmovhgzy","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T01:06:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-ci","id":1316519892},"schema_version":1}
